      "Poster lettering is replaced by unreadable geometric ribbons or blank blocks",
      "No gradients, photorealistic texture, print grain, tiny isolated details, or thin decorative filigree",
      "Use exactly 4 foreground colors for Easy, 5 for Medium, and 6 for Hard",
      "Reference is an original gameplay reinterpretation, not a facsimile of the museum image"
    ]
  },
